cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "tokamak-ms-surrogate: a differentiable vertical-stability-margin (m_s) surrogate for MAST-U (dataset + code)"
abstract: >-
  A learned, amortized, differentiable surrogate for the Portone-2005 vertical
  stability margin m_s of a spherical tokamak (MAST-U), whose gradient is used to
  drive solver-confirmed shape design, on open FreeGSNKE data. Includes the
  synthetic training dataset, verified numerical artifacts, and figures.
